14: Class `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpLiteral` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Literal`.
25: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpFile::setStrictTypes()` is replaced by `setStrictTypes(state: $s)`.
26: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpFile::getStrictTypes()` is replaced by `PhpFile::hasStrictTypes()`.
27: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpFile::addNamespace()` is replaced by `addNamespace(namespace: $n)`.
28: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpNamespace::getBracketedSyntax()` is replaced by `PhpNamespace::hasBracketedSyntax()`.
30: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::class()` is replaced by `new \Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType($name)`.
31: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setExtends()` is replaced by `setExtends(name: $n)`.
32: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::addExtend()` is removed: a class extends at most one class, set it with `setExtends()`; `addExtend()` is left to `Nette\PhpGenerator\InterfaceType`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
33: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setTraits()` is replaced by `setTraits(traits: $n)`.
34: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\TraitsAware::addTrait()` is replaced by `addTrait($name)`.
36: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\TraitsAware::addTrait()` is deprecated: call `addResolution()` on the `Nette\PhpGenerator\TraitUse` that `addTrait()` returns, once for each resolution, since nette/php-generator 4.1.
37: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpNamespace::add()` is replaced by `add(item: $c)`.
39: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::interface()` is replaced by `new \Nette\PhpGenerator\InterfaceType($name)`.
40: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::trait()` is replaced by `new \Nette\PhpGenerator\TraitType($name)`.
41: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::enum()` is replaced by `new \Nette\PhpGenerator\EnumType($name)`.
44: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\VisibilityAware::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(value: $v)`.
44: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::VISIBILITY_PUBLIC` is replaced by `ClassType::VisibilityPublic`.
44: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::VisibilityPublic` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Visibility::Public`.
46: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\PropertyLike::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(get: $v)`.
46: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\PropertyLike::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(value: $v)`.
46: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::VisibilityProtected` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Visibility::Protected`.
47: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Property::setType()` is replaced by `setType(type: $t)`.
47: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\Type::STRING` is replaced by `Type::String`.
48: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\PropertyLike::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(get: $v)`.
50: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\VisibilityAware::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(value: $v)`.
51: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\FunctionLike::setReturnType()` is replaced by `setReturnType(type: $t)`.
51: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\Type::STRING` is replaced by `Type::String`.
60: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::$methods` is replaced by `getMethods()`.
61: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::$properties` is replaced by `setProperties($value)`.
62: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\Method::$body` is replaced by `setBody($value)`.
63: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\Method::$body` is replaced by `getBody()`.
64: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\Parameter::$defaultValue` is replaced by `getDefaultValue()`.
65: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\Property::$value` is replaced by `setValue($value)`.
65: Class `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpLiteral` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Literal`.
67: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Parameter::setTypeHint()` is replaced by `Parameter::setType()`.
68: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Parameter::setTypeHint()` is replaced by `setType(type: $t)`.
69: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Parameter::getTypeHint()` is replaced by `Parameter::getType()`.
70: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Parameter::setOptional()` is removed: set a default value with `setDefaultValue()`, which is what makes the parameter optional, since nette/php-generator 4.0.
71: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\FunctionLike::getReturnNullable()` is replaced by `FunctionLike::isReturnNullable()`.
72: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\FunctionLike::setNamespace()` is removed: there is no replacement; the call had no effect since it was deprecated, since nette/php-generator 4.0.
74: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::getType()` is removed: a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType` is always a class; the kind of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike` is told by `instanceof` or by `isInterface()`, `isTrait()` and `isEnum()`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
74: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::TYPE_INTERFACE` is deprecated: test the kind of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike` with `instanceof` or with `isInterface()`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
75: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setClass()` is removed: a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType` is always a class; drop the call, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
78: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setInterface()` is removed: create the interface as `new Nette\PhpGenerator\InterfaceType($name)`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
79: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setTrait()` is removed: create the trait as `new Nette\PhpGenerator\TraitType($name)`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
80: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::setType()` is removed: create an object of the kind wanted, `new Nette\PhpGenerator\InterfaceType($name)` or `new Nette\PhpGenerator\TraitType($name)`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
81: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::addCase()` is removed: an enum is a `Nette\PhpGenerator\EnumType`, which holds the cases, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
82: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::getCases()` is removed: an enum is a `Nette\PhpGenerator\EnumType`, which holds the cases, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
83: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::getTraitResolutions()` is replaced by `ClassType::getTraits()`.
84: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::TYPE_CLASS` is deprecated: test the kind of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike` with `instanceof` or with `isClass()`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
84: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::TYPE_TRAIT` is deprecated: test the kind of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike` with `instanceof` or with `isTrait()`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
84: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::TYPE_ENUM` is deprecated: test the kind of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike` with `instanceof` or with `isEnum()`, since nette/php-generator 4.0.1.
86: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::VisibilityPublic` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Visibility::Public`.
87: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::VISIBILITY_PRIVATE` is replaced by `ClassLike::VisibilityPrivate`.
87: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::VisibilityPrivate` is replaced by `Nette\PhpGenerator\Visibility::Private`.
93: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::withBodiesFrom()` is replaced by `from($class, withBodies: true)`.
94: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassLike::from()` is replaced by `from($class, $withBodies)`.
95: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Factory::fromClassReflection()` is replaced by `fromClassReflection($from, $withBodies)`.
96: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\GlobalFunction::withBodyFrom()` is replaced by `from($function, withBody: true)`.
98: Property `Nette\PhpGenerator\Closure::$body` is replaced by `setBody($value)`.
104: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Type::getType()` is replaced by `\get_debug_type($value)`.
105: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Type::nullable()` is replaced by `nullable(nullable: $s, ...)`.
106: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpNamespace::unresolveName()` is replaced by `PhpNamespace::simplifyName()`.
107: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpNamespace::unresolveType()` is replaced by `PhpNamespace::simplifyType()`.
109: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\PhpNamespace::NAME_NORMAL` is replaced by `PhpNamespace::NameNormal`.
110: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::WRAP_LENGTH` is removed: set the property `$wrapLength` of a `Nette\PhpGenerator\Dumper` object, since nette/php-generator 3.3.
111: Constant `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::INDENT_LENGTH` is removed: there is no replacement; the width of a tab is a private constant of `Nette\PhpGenerator\Dumper`; write the value `4`, since nette/php-generator 3.3.
112: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::indentPhp()` is removed: call `unindent()` to dedent or `Nette\Utils\Strings::indent()` to indent; neither protects the contents of strings and heredocs, since nette/php-generator 3.4.1.
114: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::dump()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\PhpGenerator\Dumper)->dump($var)`.
115: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::format()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\PhpGenerator\Dumper)->format($statement, ...$args)`.
116: Static method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Helpers::formatArgs()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\PhpGenerator\Dumper)->format($statement, ...$args)`.
