123: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Traits\PropertyLike::setVisibility()` is replaced by `setVisibility(get: $v)`.
124: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::inheritMethod()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassManipulator($this))->inheritMethod($name, ...)`.
125: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassType::inheritProperty()` is replaced by `(new \Nette\PhpGenerator\ClassManipulator($this))->inheritProperty($name, ...)`.
132: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Printer::printReturnType()` is deprecated: the printer no longer calls it; override `printType()`, which prints every type: of a return value, a parameter and a property, since nette/php-generator 3.3.4.
134: Method `Nette\PhpGenerator\Printer::printReturnType()` is deprecated: the printer no longer calls it; override `printType()`, which prints every type: of a return value, a parameter and a property, since nette/php-generator 3.3.4.
